{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"dc5744dd-b538-4c6e-9fde-c03fc766c192","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The analytics events from [docs/EVENTS.md](file:///tmp/h-HnIqak/docs/EVENTS.md) have been implemented on the registration and offers screens using the existing [Analytics](file:///tmp/h-HnIqak/lib/analytics.dart) wrapper, and a full write-up has been created in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-HnIqak/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n1. **[RegistrationScreen](file:///tmp/h-HnIqak/lib/screens/registration_screen.dart)**:\n   - `registration_email_started`: Tracked on the first character entered in the email field using a `_emailStartedFired` boolean guard (no PII sent).\n   - `registration_phone_started`: Tracked on the first character entered in the phone field using a `_phoneStartedFired` boolean guard (no PII sent).\n   - `loan_amount_changed`: Tracked on `Slider.onChangeEnd` with `{'amount': v.round()}` (`int`) to capture only when the drag completes.\n   - `terms_accepted`: Tracked when the terms and conditions checkbox transitions to checked.\n   - `registration_continue_tapped`: Tracked in the Continue button `onPressed` callback with `{'amount': _amount.round(), 'terms': _terms}`.\n\n2. **[OfferScreen](file:///tmp/h-HnIqak/lib/screens/offer_screen.dart)**:\n   - `offers_scrolled`: Tracked using `NotificationListener\u003cScrollEndNotification\u003e` wrapping the list view, capturing `{'offset': notification.metrics.pixels}` (`double`) only when the scroll settles.\n\n3. **[ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-HnIqak/ANSWER.md)**:\n   - Documented what was implemented and analyzed which parts of the colleague's note applied (once-per-visit flags for text fields, `onChangeEnd` for sliders, and `ScrollEndNotification` for scrolls) versus what was ignored (focus loss for values, tap listeners, and debouncing).\n","duration_seconds":100.305916,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":202231,"output_tokens":4595,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":111713,"total_tokens":206826}}}
